      "id": "h5ksUZlrVGBjq6p4",
      "name": "Radiant Armament",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "h5ksUZlrVGBjq6p4",
        "folder": "CgI0Bt8apyQaegHF",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Radiant Armament",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your blessed armament radiates power, further enhancing your chosen weapon. When you choose the weapon for your blessed armament during your daily preparations, add the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Astral] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Brilliant] property runes to the list of effects you can choose from. If you're holy, also add the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Holy] rune, and if you're unholy, also add the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Unholy] rune.</p>\n<p>In addition, you can change the rune you've selected for the day to a different rune from your list as a 10-minute activity that has the concentrate, divine, and exploration traits. Changing the rune doesn't restore abilities that can be used only a limited number of times, such as Holy Healing for the <em>holy</em> rune</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Blessed Armament]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "blessed armament"
              }
            ]
          },
